        "body": "Fathom is a San Francisco-based, for-profit public company (ticker: FTHM, CIK: 0001753162) founded in 2020. Its core product is the Fathom AI Notetaker, which the company describes as capturing, transcribing, and summarizing calls on Zoom, Google Meet, and Microsoft Teams. The service is offered free to individuals, with additional team-oriented features including AI-powered CRM updates, AI Scorecards for real-time coaching and performance metrics, auto-generated action items, and a search interface called \"Ask Fathom\" that the company says allows users to query meeting content and receive customizable summaries tailored to a team's workflow.\n\nOn the product side, Fathom falls within the notes, knowledge, and meetings category, with consent and privacy handling noted as part of its feature set. The company also maintains a registered MCP server, ai.fathom.api/mcp, described as giving AI assistants real meeting context so that outputs are grounded in a user's actual work. No litigation or SEC filing details beyond the basic registration are present in the available data.",
